{"games":[{"id":4733728555,"name":"SCP: Site-43 RP FR","desc":"SCP: Site-43 | RP FR\n\nImagine a universe where creatures and paranormal phenomena truly exist. In this universe, an organization would have been created to hide them from the eyes of the population and to avoid causing widespread panic.\nThis organization is the SCP Foundation.\nThe SCP Foundation would gather several sites around the world, most of which would aim to contain these paranormal creatures.\n\nIn this French game, you can play as a staff member (guard, scientist, doctor) or become an enemy, and try to free the creatures, called < SCP >.\n\nRules: devforum.roblox.com/t/1472624","path":"/game/4733728555-scp-site-43-rp-fr","slug":"4733728555-scp-site-43-rp-fr","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8eae99049fd85af4e27380c2f5d825f492ed116bbc94757afc7120107883a5e3.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bcdef1a5cccc88814db1683317734f7e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":13,"visitor":3381018,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-10-03T08:10:00.756Z","creator":{"name":"Studio Baguette","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":17610920645,"name":"Clone Army","desc":"NEW MORPH UPDATE!\n\nWelcome to Clone Army!\n\nCreate your own clones that follow you around!\n\nBuy upgrades to change the speed, size and jump of your clones\n\nInspired by: Big Banana Games!\n\nTags: Clone, Clone Yourself, Clone Playground, Easy, Obby, Escape\n","path":"/game/17610920645-clone-army","slug":"17610920645-clone-army","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9c5f3a5bc9e74f74b96d6353ee5987e25690b6768601aee7e0268f8b943015f2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-982b5e20dd1704ca0e30e750a859ca25/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":13,"visitor":65969724,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-07-31T00:44:57.579Z","creator":{"name":"Marka & Kuzanoka Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":5082331079,"